# A session with NO sharp optical feature, which is the shape of most real
# therapeutic sessions: brightness ramps in from 0 over 20 s, holds one rate for
# minutes, then ramps back out. There is nothing for a cross-correlation to lock
# onto, so t0 is genuinely ambiguous by seconds.
#
# Used by the regression test asserting the tool NEVER claims high confidence in
# a t0 it cannot actually determine. Before that fix it reported a t0 that was a
# full 2 s wrong as "HIGH confidence (+/-5 ms)", and then emitted a phantom
# "audio leads light" ERROR plus ten more findings downstream of it.
0        40 50 >0  255 255 255 1
A 0      240 0 >0 0 1 246 0
20000    40 50 45  255 255 255 1
A 20000  240 0 50 0 1 246 0
220000   40 50 >45 255 255 255 1
A 220000 240 0 >50 0 1 246 0
240000   40 50 0   255 255 255 1
A 240000 240 0 0 0 1 246 0
